  "body": "Elevated above Castor Bay with sweeping sea and city views, this beautifully presented home offers an exceptional lifestyle in one of the North Shore's most sought after coastal pockets.\r\n\r\nFeaturing multiple living spaces and three car garaging, the layout is both practical and versatile, ideal for families, professionals, or those seeking extra space for hobbies, storage, or a home business.\r\n\r\nThe living areas enjoy excellent indoor-outdoor flow, opening to a generous covered deck where you can relax, entertain, and watch the children play. For those with older children a second lounge provides the space necessary and the 3 car garaging provides parking for all.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a dedicated gym space provides further flexibility. It's the perfect spot for a home office, studio, or could be transformed into a self contained area for extended family or guests.\r\n\r\nConvenience is at your doorstep with public transport nearby, and a friendly local block of shops just moments away - including a bakery, convenience store, and hairdresser. Everything you need is within easy reach. There is easy access to the beautiful beaches at Castor Bay and Milford. Zoned for Campbells Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Westlake Boys and Girls High Schools.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that blends lifestyle, location, and potential - all wrapped in those unforgettable Castor Bay views.",
